cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FruitTrait, please cite it as below."
title: "FruitTrait: Colour of Fleshy Fruits from Field Photographs"
abstract: >-
  R package with an optional Python back end that measures the colour of single
  fleshy fruits in field photographs: it detects fruits with Grounding DINO,
  outlines every fruit with Segment Anything 2.1, checks each outline, classifies
  fruits as single and ripe, and returns the CIELAB colour of every fruit and of
  the ripe fruits of each photograph, with a catalogue of the repeatability and
  invariance of every trait.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
